    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Schnittger Bourne is pleased to present this stunning, tastefully decorated penthouse apartment to the lettings market. Boasting a wraparound balcony and flooded with natural light thanks to double-height windows, this two-bedroom property offers quiet, comfortable living in an established development. With sleek, high-end finishes throughout, No. 44 is one of just three penthouse apartments and enjoys peaceful views of the surrounding landscaped gardens. Accommodation briefly comprises an open plan living/dining room, kitchen, utility, master bedroom with en suite, double bedroom, main bathroom, and storage. There are also two designated parking spaces. Delgany Hills is a mix of contemporary townhouses, penthouses, and apartments, all designed to high specification. In turnkey condition, No. 44 is available to let on a minimum 12-month lease. Viewing is highly recommended. \r\n\r\n Location: Completed in 2014 by Tower Homes, Delgany Hills is meticulously maintained and offers peaceful living within walking distance of all local amenities. The N11 is easily accessible and Greystones Dart Station just a short drive from your door."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation: \r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway - Entry through a private hallway, Engineered hardwood flooring, intercom security system. \r\n\r\nKitchen - Tiled flooring, sleek cabinetry, integrated appliances including a double oven, hob, dishwasher and undermounted sink, island incorporating storage. \r\n\r\nLiving/Dining - Engineered hardwood flooring, double height ceiling, access to wraparound balcony. Utility -Tiled flooring, washing dryer, undermounted sink, full height built-in storage. \r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - Engineered hardwood flooring, built-in wardrobes, access to balcony, Leading to En Suite - Fully tiled, shower unit, wall-mounted wash hand basin and vanity unit, WC. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - Engineered hardwood flooring, built-in wardrobes, access to balcony. Main Bathroom - Fully tiled, bath, shower unit, wall-mounted wash hand basin and vanity unit, WC."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Penthouse apartment\r\n- Private, well-maintained and established development\r\n- Designated parking spaces"
      },
